    <div>
      <h1>An offline invoice generator with no subscription and crypto payment details</h1>
      <p class="deck">Create invoices, quotes and receipts on your own computer. No account, no monthly fee, nothing uploaded. Here is what an offline invoice maker does well, what it can't do, and how to set up invoices that get paid, including in USDT and Bitcoin.</p>
      <p class="byline">By the QuestMart team. Updated September 19, 2026. 9 minute read.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/products/invoice-studio-pro.html">Get Invoice Studio</a>
      <a class="btn quiet" href="#what-to-include">Read the guide</a>
    </div>

    <div class="sample" role="img" aria-label="Example of an invoice made with Invoice Studio: two line items, 20 percent VAT, a total of 1,872 dollars, a USDT wallet line and a PAID stamp.">
      <div class="top"><b>Invoice</b><span>INV-2026-0042</span></div>
