      <p>Yes. Invoice Studio is a single HTML file you open in your browser. There is no sign-up, no login and no server. You can create invoices, quotes and receipts with no internet connection and save them as PDF.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq">
      <summary>Where is my invoice data stored?</summary>
